  "details": "Our current Content Manager from our sdk on unity, features a search tool, and it shows uploaded content ordered alphabetically. \n\nThis is not very handy for someone who has alot of content, and doesnt remember what exactly they are named, so forces us to boot up vrchat just to check up names.\n\nI think an option to order our content by date instead of name, would be very useful for alot of content creators who are in the same situation as me.",
